# Wiki -- {{NAME}}

Project knowledge base. Pages are created and maintained through normal
operation and updated during `/reflect` cycles.

Format: **Obsidian markdown** with YAML frontmatter.

## Page Types

- **entities/** -- one page per significant thing (service, API, tool, library, person)
- **patterns/** -- recurring approaches, workarounds, conventions
- **decisions/** -- architectural decisions with context and rationale
- **incidents/** -- bugs found, outages, surprising discoveries

## Conventions

- Every page starts with YAML frontmatter:
  ```yaml
  ---
  tags:
    - entity         # page type (entity/pattern/decision/incident)
    - domain-tag     # domain-specific tags
  description: One-line summary of this page
  aliases:
    - alt-name       # optional alternate names for linking
  created: YYYY-MM-DD
  updated: YYYY-MM-DD
  ---
  ```
- Internal links: `[[page-name]]` (no paths, no `.md` extension)
- `[[page|display text]]` for aliased links
- Cross-reference liberally between pages

